otchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Matsuritchi.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/4/45/Matsuritchi.png/revision/latest?cb=20141206045952","caption":"Портрет · Мацуритчи"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Matsuritchi_sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/b/bc/Matsuritchi_sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20141207180516","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Мацуритчи","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Matsuritchi_V4.5_sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/e/ee/Matsuritchi_V4.5_sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20240819194106","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Мацуритчи","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:MatsuritchiMix.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/df/MatsuritchiMix.png/revision/latest?cb=20210802202222","caption":"На изображении · Мацуритчи"}],"related":[{"id":"tamagotchi-connection-version-4-5-04b989","title":"Tamagotchi Connection Version 4.5","ru":"Tamagotchi Connection Version 4.5","kind":"device","note":""},{"id":"tamagotchi-school-toy-f0c8d5","title":"Tamagotchi School (toy)","ru":"Tamagotchi School (toy)","kind":"device","note":""},{"id":"tamagotchi-m-x-e0c3cb","title":"Tamagotchi m!x","ru":"Tamagotchi m!x","kind":"device","note":"гость (NPC)"},{"id":"ura-jinsei-enjoi-tamagotchi-plus-68a64c","title":"Ura Jinsei Enjoi Tamagotchi Plus","ru":"Ura Jinsei Enjoi Tamagotchi Plus","kind":"device","note":""}]}